data: {"id": "56e36c13e65c468f-final", "run_id": "56e36c13e65c468f", "seq": 889, "ts_ms": 1789075919604, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-07/workload-dff5cbc6b-sjvxl` | CrashLoopBackOff | Pod aiops-case-07/workload-dff5cbc6b-sjvxl 处于 CrashLoopBackOff 状态，应用进程在启动并响应HTTP请求后直接退出。 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `Warning BackOff 54s (x264 over 60m) kubelet Back-off restarting failed container app` | 确认 Pod 进入 CrashLoopBackOff 状态并持续重试重启。 |\n| 2 | K8s State | kubernetes | `exit_code: 78` | 指示应用进程以特定非零码异常终止，需结合日志确定原因。 |\n| 3 | Logging | elasticsearch | `pattern: {event: \"http_request\", level: \"error\", message: \"CONFIG_MISSING\", http_status: 500, path: \"/work\"}` (发生 8 次) | 直接定位失败原因为配置缺失 (CONFIG_MISSING)，发生在业务请求路径。 |\n| 4 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `message: \"ContainersNotReady status: [app]\"` | 证实容器因异常退出导致 Pod 状态处于非就绪 (Ready=False)。 |\n| 5 | Tracing | tempo | `span: {\"name\": \"GET /work\", \"attributes\": {\"aiops.observed_mode\": \"config_missing_exit\", \"http.response.status_code\": 500}}` | 关联日志与 Trace，确认异常由应用内部配置缺失导致并直接返回 HTTP 500。 |\n\n**证据链说明**：\nKubernetes 事件 (Fact 1) 确认了重启现象，Exit Code 78 (Fact 2) 与 ELK 日志 (Fact 3) 的 `CONFIG_MISSING` 模式互为印证，说明应用非系统资源受限退出，而是业务逻辑层面的配置缺失。Tracing 记录 (Fact 5) 进一步将这一错误锁定在应用处理请求的具体路径上，证实了退出是由应用主动抛出异常引起的。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\n应用初始化/运行检查缺失必要配置 (Fact 3, Fact 5)\n\t↓\n应用抛出 CONFIG_MISSING 致命异常\n\t↓\n进程以退出码 78 终止 (Fact 2)\n\t↓\nKubernetes 判定 CrashLoopBackOff 并持续重启 (Fact 1)\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认根因为**应用因缺少必要配置（触发 `CONFIG_MISSING` 错误）而退出**。\n\n应用代码在执行过程（如初始化或处理请求 `/work`）中检测到配置缺失，主动抛出异常并返回 HTTP 500，随后进程以退出码 `78` 终止。Kubernetes 检测到容器异常退出后，触发 `CrashLoopBackOff` 机制并不断进行重启，导致了 Pod 的持续不健康状态。\n\n目前已知缺失的 ConfigMap 为 `workload-code`，但尚无法确认其中具体缺失的键名或内容（受限于未获取到的 ConfigMap 详情），仅能确认是此应用侧配置缺失导致了异常。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.4m\n├─ 问题定位: 18.6s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 55.2s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-07/workload-dff5cbc6b-sjvxl: 55.2s (Evidence 44.9s, RCA 10.1s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 9.9s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-07/workload-dff5cbc6b-sjvxl**: pod-crashloop-runtime\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 83.797, "metrics": {"run_id": "56e36c13e65c468f", "mttr": {"value": "1.4m", "seconds": 83.80441641807556, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-crashloop-runtime", "pass": true, "score": 0.9333, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.6666666666666666, "weighted_score": 0.1333}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-crashloop-runtime"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 83804.41641807556, "llm_calls": 15, "llm_duration_ms": 62095.97945213318, "tool_calls": 18, "executed_tool_calls": 11, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 6, "successful_tool_calls": 17, "failed_tool_calls": 1, "tool_duration_ms": 27445.168495178223, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 21212.29577064514}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 18602.436065673828, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 55242.21658706665, "success": true}, "evidence": {"name": "evidence", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "rca": {"name": "rca", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "conclusion": {"name": "汇总总结", "duration_ms": 9938.119173049927, "success": true}}, "success": true, "errors": []}}

